1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,330
See this tiny hole

2
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:02,259
in your pen cap?

3
00:00:02,279 --> 00:00:03,845
It's not there for the ink.

4
00:00:03,865 --> 00:00:04,755
And it's not

5
00:00:04,755 --> 00:00:05,880
to keep the tip dry.

6
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,030
Kids chew on pen caps,

7
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:08,140
and sometimes,

8
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,316
they breathe one in.

9
00:00:09,336 --> 00:00:10,276
So pen makers

10
00:00:10,276 --> 00:00:11,620
put a hole in the cap.

11
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,390
If one gets stuck

12
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:13,671
in someone's airway,

13
00:00:13,691 --> 00:00:14,431
air can still squeeze

14
00:00:14,431 --> 00:00:15,679
through the hole.

15
00:00:15,699 --> 00:00:16,569
That tiny gap

16
00:00:16,569 --> 00:00:17,959
can buy precious seconds

17
00:00:17,959 --> 00:00:19,389
until help arrives.

18
00:00:19,409 --> 00:00:21,679
It's even written into

19
00:00:21,679 --> 00:00:23,439
a safety standard:

20
00:00:23,439 --> 00:00:24,442
ISO 11540.

21
00:00:24,462 --> 00:00:25,772
Not every design

22
00:00:25,772 --> 00:00:26,708
is about looks.

23
00:00:26,728 --> 00:00:27,248
Some are about

24
00:00:27,248 --> 00:00:28,492
saving a life.

25
00:00:28,512 --> 00:00:29,412
Follow for more

26
00:00:29,412 --> 00:00:30,499
hidden designs.
